OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786952876
OL,3,CIllegal e-bike seizures more than
OL,4,Cdouble in a year across police forces
OL,6,FPolice forces in Dorset, Hampshire and
OL,7,Fthe Thames Valley are among over 11
OL,8,Fnationally that have seen the number
OL,9,Fof illegal e-bikes they seized last
OL,10,Fyear more than double, new figures
OL,11,Fshow.
OL,13,FThames Valley Police saw the highest
OL,14,Frise of the three forces, confiscating
OL,15,F425 of the machines in the 12 months
OL,16,Fto May 19 - up from 163.
OL,18,FDorset Police and Hampshire
OL,19,FConstabulary recorded rises in e-bike
OL,20,Fseizures of 91 and 90 respectively.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
