FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786952876
OL,3,CIllegal e-bike seizures more than
OL,4,Cdouble in a year across police forces
OL,6,FIt comes as data, obtained by the
OL,7,FPress Association (PA) under freedom-
OL,8,Fof-information laws, found that some
OL,9,F7,049 e-bikes were seized across the
OL,10,FUK last year.
OL,12,FThat is compared with 3,858 during the
OL,13,Fprevious 12 months.
OL,15,FThe figures prompted police,
OL,16,Fpoliticians and charities to call for
OL,17,Fnew laws to clamp down on the
OL,18,Fdangerous vehicles which have caused
OL,19,Fdeaths and serious injuries in some
OL,20,Fcases.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786952876
OL,3,CIllegal e-bike seizures more than
OL,4,Cdouble in a year across police forces
OL,6,FUnder UK law, legal e-bikes are known
OL,7,Fas electrically assisted pedal cycles
OL,8,F(EAPCs) and must meet certain safety
OL,9,Fregulations, such as their electric
OL,10,Fmotor having a maximum power output of
OL,11,F250 watts and cutting out when a speed
OL,12,Fof 15.5mph is reached.
OL,14,FMany illegal e-bikes confiscated by
OL,15,Fpolice have been modified to travel
OL,16,Fmuch faster, with some exceeding 70mph.
OL,18,FNon-compliant machines are effectively
OL,19,Felectric mopeds or motorbikes, which
OL,20,Fmust be registered, taxed and insured.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786952876
OL,3,CIllegal e-bike seizures more than
OL,4,Cdouble in a year across police forces
OL,6,FWhile major retailers sell thousands
OL,7,Fof legal e-bikes every year, many
OL,8,Fillegal machines are bought on the
OL,9,Finternet.
OL,11,FKits which add an electronic motor to
OL,12,Fa conventional bike are available
OL,13,Fonline for under #300.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,18,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786952876
OL,3,CIllegal e-bike seizures more than
OL,4,Cdouble in a year across police forces
OL,6,FAs well as being used for crime,
OL,7,Fillegal e-bikes are often used for
OL,8,Flegitimate journeys, including food
OL,9,Fdeliveries and commuting.
OL,11,FThirty-one police forces out of 45
OL,12,Facross the UK provided comparable data
OL,13,Fafter PA's freedom-of-information
OL,14,Frequests.
OL,16,FE-bikes have been behind a string of
OL,17,Fserious incidents, including in Poole,
OL,18,FDorset, last January, when a pregnant
OL,19,Fwoman in her 30s was struck by an e-
OL,20,Fbike while crossing a road.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786952876
OL,3,CIllegal e-bike seizures more than
OL,4,Cdouble in a year across police forces
OL,6,FShe was taken to hospital where she
OL,7,Fprematurely gave birth to a seriously
OL,8,Fill baby.
OL,10,FA government spokeswoman said:
OL,11,F"Illegal e-bikes that can reach
OL,12,Fdangerous speeds have no place on our
OL,13,Froads and pavements, and the rise in
OL,14,Fseizures shows the scale of the
OL,15,Fproblem police are dealing with.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786952876
OL,3,CIllegal e-bike seizures more than
OL,4,Cdouble in a year across police forces
OL,6,F"That's why we have strengthened
OL,7,Fpolice powers, changing the law so
OL,8,Fthat officers no longer need to issue
OL,9,Fa warning before seizing these
OL,10,Fvehicles where they are used anti-
OL,11,Fsocially."
OL,13,FThese tougher powers came into force
OL,14,Fon June 29 under the Crime and
OL,15,FPolicing Act 2026.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
